A vibrant Marc Chagall-style dreamlike scene celebrating Chinese New Year: floating red lanterns drift through a deep indigo night sky alongside whimsical figures in traditional Chinese robes soaring weightlessly among stylized clouds. A majestic golden dragon spirals through the composition with folkloric charm, its serpentine body weaving between blooming plum blossoms and scattered mandarin oranges. Red envelopes flutter like birds through the air. Below, tilted rooftops of traditional shophouses glow warmly in rich reds and golds, defying perspective in Chagall's signature floating style. Fireworks burst in soft, painterly explosions of crimson, gold, and jade green, their light reflecting off everything with an ethereal luminosity. The entire scene radiates joy, prosperity, and magical celebration through bold colors and fantastical surrealism.
